{"2051640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Merchant's Guide to the Kingdom", "steam_appid": 2051640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A Living Simulated MMORPG World</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a living fantasy world where heroes travel, trade, fight, level, and pursue their goals. Watch towns grow, dungeons evolve, economies shift, and adventurers carve their own paths across the realm as you influence the world from the perspective of a Merchant and Guild Master, safe at his shop. Every decision you make contributes to a constantly evolving MMORPG-inspired simulation filled with opportunity, danger, and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/dfd150b2526c45b4ffb701541e1a866a.poster.avif?t=1779763701\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/dfd150b2526c45b4ffb701541e1a866a.webm?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/dfd150b2526c45b4ffb701541e1a866a.mp4?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Build a Guild Worth Remembering</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and manage your own guild of adventurers, beginning with a loyal group of customizable officers who will follow your commands into the realm’s greatest dangers. Potentially even to their deaths. Recruit promising heroes from across the world, specialize their roles, equip them with powerful gear, and assemble parties capable of conquering deadly dungeons, world events, and large-scale raids. As your guild grows in strength and reputation, so too will its influence across the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/5cadedeb72b4309e103729da2a423742.poster.avif?t=1779763701\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/5cadedeb72b4309e103729da2a423742.webm?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/5cadedeb72b4309e103729da2a423742.mp4?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Shape the Economy and Guide the Realm</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are more than a guild master, you are a driving force behind the realm itself. Craft valuable equipment, upgrade resource networks, and post strategic quests that influence the actions of adventurers throughout the world. Encourage heroes toward unexplored regions, strengthen the economy of nearby settlements, and help shape the progression of the realm through careful planning and long-term strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A World Driven by Adventure</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except for your Guild Officers, heroes throughout the kingdom act on their own ambitions, forming parties, accepting quests, exploring dangerous regions, and competing for fame, fortune, and survival. Some may rise to become legends known across the kingdom, while others fall during perilous expeditions. Through both triumph and failure, the world continuously evolves around the stories created by its adventurers and the choices you make along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Choose Your Preferred Challenge</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor the experience to your preferred style of play with multiple gameplay options, including a more forgiving experience on Softcore, or a high-stakes Hardcore mode featuring permanent hero death. In harsher settings, every expedition carries meaningful risk, adding tension and long-term consequence to your decisions while rewarding careful preparation, strategy, and resource management. Or, just fish all day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/05d1e8683da81e085fcf9e1cee5ed44e.poster.avif?t=1779763701\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/05d1e8683da81e085fcf9e1cee5ed44e.webm?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/05d1e8683da81e085fcf9e1cee5ed44e.mp4?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A Living Simulated MMORPG World</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a living fantasy world where heroes travel, trade, fight, level, and pursue their goals. Watch towns grow, dungeons evolve, economies shift, and adventurers carve their own paths across the realm as you influence the world from the perspective of a Merchant and Guild Master, safe at his shop. Every decision you make contributes to a constantly evolving MMORPG-inspired simulation filled with opportunity, danger, and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/dfd150b2526c45b4ffb701541e1a866a.poster.avif?t=1779763701\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/dfd150b2526c45b4ffb701541e1a866a.webm?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/dfd150b2526c45b4ffb701541e1a866a.mp4?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Build a Guild Worth Remembering</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and manage your own guild of adventurers, beginning with a loyal group of customizable officers who will follow your commands into the realm’s greatest dangers. Potentially even to their deaths. Recruit promising heroes from across the world, specialize their roles, equip them with powerful gear, and assemble parties capable of conquering deadly dungeons, world events, and large-scale raids. As your guild grows in strength and reputation, so too will its influence across the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/5cadedeb72b4309e103729da2a423742.poster.avif?t=1779763701\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/5cadedeb72b4309e103729da2a423742.webm?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/5cadedeb72b4309e103729da2a423742.mp4?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Shape the Economy and Guide the Realm</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are more than a guild master, you are a driving force behind the realm itself. Craft valuable equipment, upgrade resource networks, and post strategic quests that influence the actions of adventurers throughout the world. Encourage heroes toward unexplored regions, strengthen the economy of nearby settlements, and help shape the progression of the realm through careful planning and long-term strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A World Driven by Adventure</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except for your Guild Officers, heroes throughout the kingdom act on their own ambitions, forming parties, accepting quests, exploring dangerous regions, and competing for fame, fortune, and survival. Some may rise to become legends known across the kingdom, while others fall during perilous expeditions. Through both triumph and failure, the world continuously evolves around the stories created by its adventurers and the choices you make along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Choose Your Preferred Challenge</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor the experience to your preferred style of play with multiple gameplay options, including a more forgiving experience on Softcore, or a high-stakes Hardcore mode featuring permanent hero death. In harsher settings, every expedition carries meaningful risk, adding tension and long-term consequence to your decisions while rewarding careful preparation, strategy, and resource management. Or, just fish all day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/05d1e8683da81e085fcf9e1cee5ed44e.poster.avif?t=1779763701\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/05d1e8683da81e085fcf9e1cee5ed44e.webm?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/extras/05d1e8683da81e085fcf9e1cee5ed44e.mp4?t=1779763701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "You are an NPC and shopkeeper in a simulated MMORPG world. Trade, craft and manage a guild to acquire powerful gear and face dangerous dungeons, world bosses, rare spawns and up to 40-man raids while following the campaign to aid in the protection of the ancient and powerful Elemental Stones.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/header.jpg?t=1779763701", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779763701", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779763701", "website": "https://merchants.guide/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 GHz Intel Core 2 Duo, AMD Athlon 64 Dual-Core 4000+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128 MB of Video RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requirements likely to change in future versions.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or higher, AMD Athlon X4 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 10 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 650 or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requirements likely to change in future versions.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS X 10.11 (El Capitan)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3225 3.3 Ghz (2 cores, 4 threads) or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 (Integrated Graphics) or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong